          (text "High-side isolated gate driver and bias" (at 297.18 10.16 0)
          (effects (font (size 3.5 3.5) (bold yes)) (justify top))
          (uuid "689a1340-47ed-5207-beec-29f1c59a1acd"))
(text "UCC21710 IN+ = PWM_H_F, IN- = PWM_L_F (hardware interlock KR-GD-009); AIN tied to COM (CR-01); APWM not connected. UCC14141 VDD-VEE 19.0 V (107 k / 16.2 k) and COM-VEE\n4.0 V (9.76 k / 16.2 k) give +15 V / -4 V at the gate; RLIM 1 k is a placeholder (human review). Decoupling sits between the driver pins and the gate/Kelvin connection\n(KR-PCB-002); KS_H is never joined to SW on the PCB (KR-PCB-003)." (at 6.35 15.24 0)
          (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
          (uuid "5854af1b-d6c3-5a7d-990b-b17e0c94329f"))
